@host = http://localhost

### Login (stores the token for the requests below)
POST {{host}}/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Search products by name prefix
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=aut&category_id=01a0edee-18ce-732e-b88d-ce31ddbe92d5&status=active&page=2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search + status filter
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=ci&status=active
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search + category filter (replace the category id)
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=ci&category_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search, second page
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=ci&page=2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No search (baseline)
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
